The Ria Money Transfer app is the best way to send money to family and friends worldwide. Get exclusive rates and a $0 fee on your first transfer with code: HELLORIA

Download the app today and see why millions of customers have been trusting Ria for over 35 years for fast, safe, and easy international remittance transfers. Terms and conditions below*

RELIABLE AND FAST
Trusted in the remittance business for 35 years, Ria has safely delivered over a billion transfers globally.  With over 500,000 cash pickup locations around the world in over 190 countries, Ria Money Transfer helps you get money to where it matters most.  Beyond just consistent, reliable service, with Ria, you can send money internationally in minutes using your bank account, credit card, or debit card**. 

EASY TO USE 
Customers consistently call the Ria app "easy to use"! We offer several features that make your transfer experience better.  Do you often send the same amount to the same people? Repeat your transfers with a couple of taps using our Send Again feature. Do you like knowing your transfer's progress? Use our Track a Transfer feature to see updates on the status of your money.

CONVENIENT
With 500,000 pickup locations in over 190 countries, Ria helps send your money where it matters most. Plus, receiving money is always convenient for your loved ones. They can choose several options for their delivery method: cash pickup, bank deposit, mobile wallets, and home delivery***.

*Terms and conditions for HELLORIA: 
Terms and conditions vary depending on your sending location. The promo code HELLORIA must be quoted at the time of checkout when the money transfer order is placed. The promo code can only be used once per customer and cannot be combined with any other promo codes. The offer is valid for use on money transfers when using the Ria mobile application, app, or the Ria website. 

Sending from the US, Canada, Chile, New Zealand, and Australia:
To use this promo code, send at least 50 in your selected currency (not including any customer fee or other costs relating to the transfer).

Sending from Malaysia:
To use this promo code, send at least 100 in your selected currency (not including any customer fee or other costs relating to the transfer).

Other:
No other countries require a minimum send amount.

**Payment method availability depends on the sending country. 
***Delivery method availability depends on the receiving country.

